&lt;td&gt;
&lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/components/multi-select" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Multi-select&lt;/a&gt; (Pro)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Sheet with a "Done (3)" footer&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
