&lt;td&gt;Consent to terms&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;a href="https://wingo-ui.com/components/checkbox" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Checkbox&lt;/a&gt; (Free)&lt;/td&gt;
